The comparison separates the WO₃ references into two structural families. The initially favored entry is not merely a different cell setting: it fails to match the three physically valid WO₃ structures and contains 1.57 Å O–O contacts. I’m therefore rerunning the refinement from canonicalized valid references (not just accepting the slightly lower preliminary residual).

