The close triclinic WO₃ alternative can lower Rwp by only 0.007 percentage point, but only by distorting its cell about 1.39% from the reference—well outside the stated 0.5% reference-variation envelope. The monoclinic P2₁/c model needs only 0.34% strain and all three refined structures pass the contact screen, so it is the defensible model. I’m doing one final bounded coordinate/ADP pass on that model and then freezing/exporting the deliverables.

